      <data key="d1">artifact</data>
      <data key="d2">The Light Silk is a delicate piece of fabric used to demonstrate the sharpness of the sword by being effortlessly cut in two.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e</data>
