    <node id="锦衫剑士">
      <data key="d0">锦衫剑士</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">锦衫剑士is a swordsman dressed in brocade, who engages in a duel with青衣剑士but is ultimately defeated and killed.&lt;SEP&gt;锦衫剑士is a group of swordsmen characterized by their heavy swords and aggressive fighting style, often engaging in duels with青衣剑士.&lt;SEP&gt;锦衫剑士are warriors from the palace of the Yue King, skilled in swordsmanship and loyal to their ruler.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e58ecd9d19ebc5fffab3dc66a3dbd19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c903f2e907674391708383e3d1afe7fb</data>
