    <node id="青衣剑士">
      <data key="d0">青衣剑士</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">青衣剑士is a swordsman dressed in green, known for his cunning and skillful swordsmanship, ultimately defeating his opponent using strategy and a protective copper mirror.&lt;SEP&gt;青衣剑士is a skilled swordsman known for their sharp sword and exceptional swordsmanship, defeating multiple opponents in combat.&lt;SEP&gt;青衣剑士are swordsmen sent by the Wu King as emissaries, demonstrating exceptional coordination and swordsmanship.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e58ecd9d19ebc5fffab3dc66a3dbd19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c903f2e907674391708383e3d1afe7fb</data>
