    <node id="越国">
      <data key="d0">越国</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">越国is the kingdom ruled by the Yue King, known for its efforts to rebuild its strength after defeat by Wu.&lt;SEP&gt;越国is the kingdom ruled by勾践, known for its historical sword-making tradition.&lt;SEP&gt;Yue is a region or state where the events take place, represented by范蠡and his guards.&lt;SEP&gt;越国is a region associated with范蠡and the越国卫士.&lt;SEP&gt;越国is a historical state mentioned in the context of military training and strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;越国is the kingdom where the events take place, including阿青's training of swordsmen and the eventual rise of its military power.&lt;SEP&gt;越国is the kingdom led by范蠡that defeats the Wu army in battle.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
