    </node>
    <node id="吴国">
      <data key="d0">吴国</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">吴国is the kingdom ruled by the Wu King, known for its military strength and rivalry with Yue.&lt;SEP&gt;吴国is a neighboring kingdom known for its skilled swordsmiths and possession of legendary swords.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu is a region or state from which the swordsmen originate, involved in the conflict with Yue.&lt;SEP&gt;吴国is a region associated with the吴国剑士who confront阿青.&lt;SEP&gt;吴国is a historical state mentioned in relation to越国and the吴王宫.&lt;SEP&gt;吴国is a neighboring kingdom that is eventually defeated by越国in battle.&lt;SEP&gt;吴国is the kingdom ruled by夫差, which is defeated by the Yue army.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66</data>
