    <node id="剑道">
      <data key="d0">剑道</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">剑道refers to the principles and ethics of swordsmanship, emphasized by the官员during the duels.&lt;SEP&gt;剑道refers to the way of the sword, emphasizing discipline and principles in swordsmanship.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0e58ecd9d19ebc5fffab3dc66a3dbd19</data>
