      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wu Zixu was a loyal minister of Wu who advised against Yue's strategies but was forced to commit suicide due to political intrigue.&lt;SEP&gt;Wu Zixu is a high-ranking official of the Wu Kingdom who obtained the Gongbu sword and sought assistance in forging weapons.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401</data>
