      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Wen Zhong is a minister who admired Fan Li's talents and worked with him to assist Yue King Goujian in governance and strategy.&lt;SEP&gt;Wen Zhong is an advisor to Goujian who reacts with concern to the developments involving Wu Zixu.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401</data>
