    <node id="范蠡">
      <data key="d0">范蠡</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">范蠡, also known as Fan Li, is a prominent historical figure and advisor in the Yue Kingdom during the Spring and Autumn period of ancient China. He served as a trusted counselor to King Goujian of Yue, playing a critical role in diplomatic exchanges and military strategy.范蠡 is renowned for his strategic thinking, leadership, and ability to navigate complex situations with restraint and foresight. His contributions were instrumental in the Yue Kingdom's efforts to recover from its defeat by the neighboring Wu Kingdom and ultimately achieve victory.

范蠡 is depicted as a skilled swordsman and a leader among the Yue guards, actively involved in organizing and training the Yue swordsmen. He demonstrates a keen interest in the art of swordsmanship, particularly in the extraordinary abilities of阿青, a mysterious and highly skilled swordswoman.范蠡 admires阿青's talents and seeks to understand the origins of her abilities, offering her assistance and compensation in return. His interactions with阿青 highlight his ability to inspire loyalty and foster collaboration among those he leads.

范蠡's character is also deeply intertwined with西施, a legendary beauty and key figure in the Yue Kingdom's strategy to undermine the Wu Kingdom. His connection with西施 is both personal and strategic, as he faces dilemmas and makes plans to protect her from danger.范蠡 reflects on his past experiences and emotions, including his thoughts about西施, which reveal a more introspective and human side to his character.

Throughout his involvement in the Yue Kingdom's affairs,范蠡 demonstrates a balance of tactical acumen, emotional depth, and leadership qualities. His role in organizing the Yue army, handling diplomatic challenges, and navigating interpersonal relationships underscores his significance as a multifaceted figure in Chinese history and legend.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6</data>
      <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
