      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">阿青is a young shepherdess with exceptional swordsmanship skills, capable of defeating multiple吴国剑士using a bamboo stick. She seeks justice for her slain sheep.&lt;SEP&gt;阿青is a young, beautiful, and skilled rural girl who uses a bamboo stick and interacts closely with范蠡.&lt;SEP&gt;阿青is a highly skilled swordswoman who uses a bamboo stick to demonstrate extraordinary sword techniques and defeats numerous opponents.&lt;SEP&gt;阿青is a woman who harbors feelings for范蠡and expresses a desire to kill西施out of jealousy.&lt;SEP&gt;阿青is a skilled fighter with a bamboo stick, deeply loyal to范蠡, and conflicted upon encountering西施's beauty.</data>
