      <data key="d2">The Wu swordsmen are a group of eight skilled warriors from Wu, known for their arrogance and exceptional swordsmanship.&lt;SEP&gt;吴国剑士are skilled warriors from吴国who are defeated and injured by阿青during a confrontation.</data>
