    <edge source="范蠡" target="阿青">
      <data key="d7">5.0</data>
      <data key="d8">范蠡offers compensation to阿青for her slain sheep and expresses interest in learning about her swordsmanship skills.&lt;SEP&gt;范蠡spends time with阿青, teaching her and engaging in close interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;范蠡observes阿青's swordsmanship and organizes the training of越国剑士based on her techniques.&lt;SEP&gt;阿青harbors unrequited feelings for范蠡and threatens to kill西施out of jealousy.&lt;SEP&gt;范蠡considers阿青a loyal friend and struggles with the moral dilemma of confronting her.</data>
      <data key="d9">admiration,companionship,compensation,conflict,curiosity,friendship,loyalty,mentor-observer,mentorship,unrequited love</data>
